       pickup_1  pickup      x=  44.0 y=  3.3 yaw= 0.35
       truck_1   fire_truck  x=  60.0 y=  3.0 yaw=-1.57
       suv_1     suv         x=  76.0 y= -3.0 yaw= 2.00
       pickup_2  pickup      x=  88.0 y=  9.8 yaw= 0.00
